      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I assume it is intended?\n\nI just unlocked the \"Mobile Hero\" badge, and it looks basically like it upgraded the \"Mobile Initiate\". I do know my friend had both shown at the same time before though, and the same happened to them as it did to you.\n\nIt weirdly enough didn't do the same thing as the gift badge, where it literally upgraded the badge. Instead it removed my \"Mobile Initiate\" badge and added the \"Mobile Hero\" badge. I had to manually show the new badge, so it is definitely treated as a separate badge.\n\nThis might all still be work-in-progress though, since it isn't fully released and such. Could also be related to the other badge issues, such as gift badges downgrading at random that some users report in #user-support.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
